project configuration” when entering BreathBound, which prevents them from playing online.After looking into it, we found this issue is usually related to your Steam client version. If you run into it, please follow the steps below:Step 1: Check your Steam client versionOpen the Steam client and click “Help” in the menu bar at the top left.Select “About Steam”.In th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:02:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028964","verified_at":"2026-10-21T14:32:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1846651706691015","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"update","title":"BreathBound Steam Next Fest Update Notes (Oct 19, 2026)","summary":"Hey there, teammates! Xiao Jiangjiang has come hopping in to report for duty~ 🧟‍♂️BreathBound is part of Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26! Add it to your wishlist now!Thank you all for your support! The demo has passed 400,000 downloads, and the infection keeps spreading!Xiao Jiangjiang has been secretly reading all your comments every single day and hasn't missed a single one! Whatever felt not-so-fun, wherever you got stuck, it's all written down in Xiao Jiangjiang's notebook. Thank you t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:15:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1846651706676269","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"announcement","title":"BreathBound Pre-Show Stream: Steam Next Fest & G-Fusion Beijing","summary":"BreathBound Pre-Show Stream: Steam Next Fest & G-Fusion BeijingBody:Hold your breath, survivors.Our pre-show stream is now live on the store page, looping the BreathBound trailer.📅 Steam Next Fest | October 19-26Download the free demo during Next Fest and team up with friends. The Corpse King can’t see you, but it can smell your breath and hear your steps.🎮 G-Fusion Beijing | October 24–25 | Booth D08 Come try BreathBound at our booth and survive together in 1-4 player co-op horror.👉 Wishlist Br","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T04:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676269","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1846651706673822","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"announcement","title":"BreathBound is confirmed for Steam Next Fest! Steady your breathing!","summary":"BreathBound is confirmed for Steam Next Fest! Steady your breathing!Hello, future teammates! Xiao Jiangjiang is here.We’re officially joining Steam Next Fest this October! （OCT19-26 AT 10 AM PT）For those who haven’t met us yet, here’s a quick introduction:BreathBound is a co-op horror game for 1–4 players. You’ll need to keep track of your surroundings—and manage your breathing and noise. You might think you’re just catching your breath, but a jiangshi might hear an invitation to dinner~But don’","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T10:13:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673822","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1844751498221367","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"update","title":"BreathBound Update Announcement | Happy Mid-Autumn Festival! (Sep 24, 2026)","summary":"BreathBound Update Announcement | Happy Mid-Autumn Festival! (Sep 24, 2026)Hello everyone! Xiao Jiangjiang is here.The Mid-Autumn Festival holiday is here! It’s time to admire the moon, enjoy some mooncakes, and—most importantly—keep your breathing under control while playing with your teammates.To celebrate the holiday, we’ve released a small update focused on improving the Breath Sharing mechanic, breathing animations, and graphics settings, along with fixes for several issues affecting the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:42:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221367","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1844115010503810","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"announcement","title":"《BreathBound》is joining Multiplayer Games Fest 2026!","summary":"《BreathBound》is joining Multiplayer Games Fest 2026!Hello everyone! Xiao Jiangjiang is here.《BreathBound》is joining Multiplayer Games Fest 2026!Shh! Don’t make a sound. It may not be able to see you, but it can hear you breathe.Explore a traditional Chinese mansion, gather resources, complete the sealing ritual, and rescue your teammates. But every breath, footstep, and collision could draw the Zombie King straight to you.Join public matchmaking or team up with friends, and challenge three diffi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T10:34:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010503810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1844115010488117","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"update","title":"# BreathBound Recent Update Announcement (Sep 16, 2026)","summary":"Hello everyone! Xiao Jiangjiang is here. By day, I sort through player feedback; by night, I sneak over to the dev team to nag them about bugs. I may look like I might bite, but I actually only chew on words. This update mainly focuses on **multiplayer, control settings, and scene experience**, and also fixes a batch of issues affecting game flow.## Multiplayer & Lobby- The maximum number of players per game room is now unified at **4**.- Once a room is full, new players can no longer join and w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T04:44:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488117","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1842846814445333","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"update","title":"《BreathBound》Weekly Update Announcement (Sep 4, 2026)","summary":"Multiplayer and Room SystemImproved Steam multiplayer functionality, including support for searching public rooms worldwide.Added invite code display and copy functionality to the lobby.Added an invite code input field to the Join Room interface.Added support for joining private rooms through Steam friend invitations.Lobby FeaturesAdded a feature that allows the host to kick party members.Improved state cleanup when players leave, are kicked, or switch sessions.Added an “Invite Code” feature to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T04:39:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1842212951312308","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"announcement","title":"Notice: Multiplayer Room Connection Issues","summary":"Hello everyone, this is Little Jiang from customer support ~ **1. The Problem**We've received quite a few reports: when creating or joining a room, the game gets stuck, times out, or simply fails to connect. The issue is real, and it's on us. Let us apologize first. **2. What's Going On**We're a two-person team, and our multiplayer currently runs on EPIC's free server service. The free tier has significant limitations in node allocation and connection stability, and cross-region matchmaking ofte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T06:35:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951312308","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5000870-1842212951305930","game_id":"steam-5000870","kind":"announcement","title":"《BreathBound》Gameplay Updates (Aug 29, 2026)","summary":"**Gameplay Updates**- **Boss Grabbing Mechanic** - Boss can now grab players at night and carry them to designated locations. - Improved the placement position of players after the Boss reaches the target location, reducing issues like getting stuck in walls, misjudgment across floors, and abnormal teleportation. - Optimized Boss pounce logic: the Boss will stop promptly upon hitting a player or obstacle; when players successfully dodge, the Boss will still pounce through the player's original p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T16:29:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305930","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5000870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5000870":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5000870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z"},"5063510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:12:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:12